uring last three years by STPI \nunits is at ANNEXURE II.   The details from IT-SEZ units is given at ANNEXURE – III.   \n    \n(b):  The Government is implementing \"India BPO Promotion Scheme (IBPS)\" and \"North \nEast BPO Promotion Scheme (NEBPS)\" under Digital India Programme . These schemes aims to \ncreate employment in Tier II/Tier III cities across the country and address issues of regional \nimbalance. \n \n(c): The Government is implementing projects/schemes such as State Wide Area Network \n(SWAN), State Data Centre  (SDC), Common Services Centres (CSCs) and e -District to ens ure \ndevelopment of IT infrastructure across the states.  \n \n****** \n \n \n\nANNEXURE-I \nSTATE WISE EXPORTS \n            (Fig. In Rs. Crore) \n State 2016-17 2015-16 2014-15 \n1 ANDHRA PRADESH 526.69 477.93 379.54 \n2 ASSAM 10.5 0.18 1.35 \n3 BIHAR 4.65 7.25 10.63 \n4 CHANDIGARH 758.82 700.79 519.89 \n5 CHHATTISGARH 36.79 23.29 18.63 \n6 DELHI 1493.75 1454.51 2229.58 \n7 GOA 185.28 169.27 149.52 \n8 GUJARAT 2363.54 2242.15 1940.69 \n9 HARYANA 21001.06 19404.78 17966.84 \n10 HIMACHAL PRADESH 6.97 5.16 8.35 \n11 JAMMU AND KASHMIR 3.58 3.35 2.45 \n12 JHARKHAND 2 49.16 7 \n13 KARNATAKA 146418.55 130265.26 114415.28 \n14 KERALA 3574.2 3061.55 2912.65 \n15 MADHYA PRADESH 516.18 355 302.28 \n16 MAHARASHTRA 71639.57 66923.11 62995.18 \n17 MEGHALAYA 7.7 6.31 4.21 \n18 ODISHA 2493.35 2179.8 1940 \n19 PUDUCHERRY 239.21 182.55 153.26 \n20 PUNJAB 425.51 337.23 351.01 \n21 RAJASTHAN 1010.01 816.45 639.05 \n22 SIKKIM 38.29 0 0 \n23 TAMIL NADU 35026.8 34163.4 33541.74 \n24 TELANGANA 46438.56 41492.66 39210.21 \n25 UTTAR PRADESH 18009.73 17510.01 26401.49 \n26 UTTARAKHAND 89.88 82.57 74.67 \n27 WEST BENGAL 7152.01 6990 7015 \n Total Country Details 359233.97 328903.72 313190.5 \n \nANNEXURE-II \n \nEmployment and investment details of STPI Units \n \nFinancial Year \nInvestment \n(In Rs. Crore) Manpower \n2016-17 14099 1794650 \n2015-16 14758 1722958 \n2014-15 15528 1797531 \n \n \n \n \n \n