way-80 is not being done properly by contractors causing several serious accidents \non this stretch;  \n(b) if so, the action taken by the Government against the contractors; and \n (c) the outcome thereof? \n \n \n           ANSWER \n \nTHE MINISTER OF STATE IN THE \nMINISTRY OF ROAD TRANSPORT AND HIGHWAYS \n(SHRI  MANSUKH L. MANDAVIYA ) \n(a) Repair and maintenance work is a continuous process and the same has been done on  \nShaebganj stretch of National Highway -80 as per Ministry’s specification . Now the stretch is in \ngood condition. \n(b) & (c) Do not arise. \n***** "}]}